{"asset_key":"ep4/env_story_14301295","episode":"ep4","category":"env_story","story_id":"14301295","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1430129501:1":{"text":"당연하지. 우리 마을에서 제일 잘 팔리는 무기들은 대부분 깊은바위 수정으로 만든 거였어.","source_cn":"那是当然，我们村子卖的最好的武器，大部分都是用深岩晶为...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9BE214890240345A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1430129502:1":{"text":"마을에 다른 광석으로 만든 무기들도 있었지만, 품질 차이가 굉장히 컸거든.","source_cn":"虽然村子里一直也在用其他矿石作为锻造材料制作武器，但质...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3763FEA3F6E95963","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1430129503:1":{"text":"무기를 사러 오는 상인들까지 줄어들면 공방을 열겠다는 내 꿈은 멀어질 거야!","source_cn":"要是买武器的商人再减少的话，那我开工坊的梦想也会随之延期！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x68B7F2D000D97E0D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:矿工奥多":{"text":"광부 오드","source":"矿工奥多","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}